functions.description:
A map of all (timeseries) variables that can be used in eCalc YAML
A variable name has the format "{name_of_case};{title_of_header} from the original
file/resource with time series, ie;

Helper function to use in a callback to get a single color.
Give in the list of active colors, and a dictionary of {column:name:value}
for each column in the color table

Returns a Dict with all possible attributes per category
on the form:
{
    "welltype":["oil_producer", "water_injector", ...],
    "category2": ...
}
